  "Trusted": "De confianza",
  "Kin": "Familia",
  "Six beacons in order against the clock.": "Seis balizas en orden contra el reloj.",
  "Three bandits on a client’s lane.": "Tres bandidos en la ruta de un cliente.",
  "Rock broken and its ore flown in against the clock.": "Romper roca y traer su mineral contra el reloj.",
  "Wanted: {name}, and friends.": "Se busca: {name}, y amigos.",
