  "Prints: PrintMe’s back room, {price} ☉ a clone, booted ragged": "Impresiones: la trastienda de PrintMe, {price} ☉ por clon, arranca a trompicones",
  "Prints: PrintMe’s counter, {price} ☉ a clone": "Impresiones: el mostrador de PrintMe, {price} ☉ por clon",
  "Next clone printed: {paid} ☉ paid, {owed} ☉ on the debt.": "Siguiente clon impreso: {paid} ☉ pagados, {owed} ☉ a la deuda.",
  "Next clone printed: {paid} ☉.": "Siguiente clon impreso: {paid} ☉.",
  "Scar: {scar} {tier}, {effect}.": "Cicatriz: {scar} {tier}, {effect}.",
  "Master: clean, untouched and in time. {bonus} ☉ bonus.": "Maestro: limpio, intacto y a tiempo. {bonus} ☉ de prima.",
  "{people} count you as {tier}.": "Para {people} ahora eres: {tier}.",
